the keys, decided last, once the ideas are settled

  ideas      each binding names its idea beside its key, so a key, a
             click and a button say one thing, and the wire carries ideas
  vi         digits a count, 3j, and a row by :N or NG; g first and G
             last everywhere; l in, as right is
  m and t    m is memory in fm and the bracket in ed; ed's next lens is
             Tab (`design/lens`), and in a lens, where nothing is typed,
             t turns the layout as in fm, though in source it is till.
             q is decided: fm's q ends the frame
             (`studio/5-verbs/10-closeverb.go:/closeVerb/`)
  the frame  ctrl-w, vim's window prefix, which no slot binds: h j k l
             move the eye, : the frame's words, q closes a slot
  one table  keys and gestures to ideas, read by view, gio, the page and
             `tmux/conf`, and listed by ?; six places decide keys today
  the word   one function finds the word at a column, as tmux, p and ed
             each do (`ed/4-view/28-wordat.go`), and p takes -w dir
  chords     tmux hands a chord only as one button's press and the
             other's release: acme's chords read from that, or keys
